# Temporary status/progress markdown files (keep only docs/)
*_STATUS*.md
*_COMPLETE*.md
*_SUMMARY*.md
*_PROGRESS*.md
*_RESULTS*.md
*_IMPLEMENTATION*.md
*_FIX*.md
