# Keep essential docs
!README.md
!DEPLOYMENT.md
!docs/*.md
!config/rules/README.md
!deploy/*.md
!tests/README.md
!scripts/README*.md
!src/ai/training/README.md

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Secrets (never commit)
*.pem
*.key
secrets.yaml
